# [MASQUE](../wg/masque.html)

## Summary

The MASQUE Working Group met at IETF 127 to review the status of its active documents, discuss updates to QUIC-aware proxying, evaluate coexistence between QUIC-aware proxying and SCONE, review updates to IP proxying DNS configuration and HTTP datagram compression, and consider qlog definitions for MASQUE protocols. 

The working group has been rechartered to include QUIC-aware proxying (`draft-ietf-masque-quic-proxy`), architecture informational documentation, and qlog extensions within scope before eventually concluding the working group.

