## Decisions and Action Items

* **`draft-ietf-masque-quic-proxy`:**
  * Retain the existing forwarding model without architectural changes for SCONE.
  * Ensure path MTU / PMTU consistency requirements between forwarded and tunneled packets are explicitly specified.
  * Clarify in the draft that forwarded mode is intended to be semantically equivalent to tunneled CONNECT-UDP mode.
  * Prepare for a Working Group Last Call (WGLC) once adoption and MTU updates are complete.

* **`draft-ietf-masque-connect-ip-dns`:**
  * Require servers to explicitly respond to DNS request capsules (sending an empty capsule if no DNS configuration is provided) to prevent client timeout issues.
  * Address memory allocation security considerations.
  * Prepare for WGLC once open issues are resolved.

